,"type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```dein#remote_plugins()\n\t\tLoad not loaded neovim |remote-plugin| and execute\n\t\t\":UpdateRemotePlugins\" command.\n\t\tIt is better than \":UpdateRemotePlugins\" for dein.\n\t\tNote: It is valid only in neovim.```","ts":"1622269773.403000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U01U44T1FK2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mlu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C8FF06EB-14E4-4121-AFB1-7B9750FF97C9","type":"message","user":"UJV04G927","text":"困ったときはいつもShougoさんの設定を見てます","ts":"1622269683.402700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g0r1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a04f7f07-b2a1-4842-9030-a960dad1d2d3","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"自動ではされないですね。多分","ts":"1622269665.402500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c06"}]},{"client_msg_id":"af1e97b2-0f86-4ced-8ee3-bbeb3a1505f3","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"遅延ロードとRemote Pluginの相性って悪かったと思うので、もし遅延ロードしてるなら1回外してみた方がいいと思います","ts":"1622269587.401300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wMka"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52ae48ea-c6fd-4384-af37-742bd44b78bb","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"最近Remote Plugin使ってないけどdeinって自動でUpdateRemotePlugins叩かれるんじゃないですっけ","ts":"1622269553.400600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qMG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e7ab8e17-ff8c-4db2-9557-b6c0de71470a","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"deniteを入れてみてちょっと困惑したところ\n単純にdeinでインストールしたばかりだと:UpdateRemotePluginsしなさいと怒られるので\nhook_post_sourceに:UpdateRemotePluginsを仕込むことで2回め以降の起動から正常に動作させられるようになったんですが\n初回起動時からエラー出さない方法ってあります?","ts":"1622269483.399900","edited":{"user":"U01U44T1FK2","ts":"1622269514.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RN6F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08cadb53-a738-4552-87c2-e8411dc3b059","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"ドキュメントのdein-installの項の一番下に書いてました\n```If you need vim-plug like install UI, you can use dein-ui.vim.\n\u003chttps://github.com/wsdjeg/dein-ui.vim\u003e```","ts":"1622265630.395400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qs0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ade14c0a-fd6e-4279-9f98-e0875b0041e6","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"`haya14busa/dein-command.vim` ってやつを古来から使ってた","ts":"1622265544.395100","thread_ts":"1622265544.395100","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dfF+p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"33752500-2aee-42c7-bdc6-d56fc808adb2","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"へー、dein-uiなんてあるんだ","ts":"1622265529.394700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bMy4l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8330102d-df76-47e7-b3cf-7a0fa9b0f1be","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"読み込みできた気がします、ありがとうございます！","ts":"1622265493.394400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4I3n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5dbf46ee-cbf6-4853-b2a7-b0e31c96a057","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"ドキュメントに載ってたdein-ui使えば、:DeinUpdateでvim-plug風のバッファが出て進行が見やすかった","ts":"1622265488.394300","edited":{"user":"U01U44T1FK2","ts":"1622265531.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01ATUT6PL3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IbsR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0a71f22-6010-47d1-a48a-d24ad24ba883","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"毎回check_clean走らせてるので自動で消えて自動で追加される\nつまりtomlと冪等（適当）","ts":"1622265419.394000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01ATUT6PL3"]},{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s7bgJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce9436ce-eeb4-4183-aeb1-919b723d4737","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"（updateするとき大体deinのインストール先のディレクトリ吹っ飛ばしてやってるなんて言えない）","ts":"1622265374.393200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jEL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e437bda-071a-4a0b-8ea4-9b4452971059","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```if isdirectory(expand('~/repos/github.com/yuki-yano/fzf-preview.vim'))\n  call dein#add('~/repos/github.com/yuki-yano/fzf-preview.vim', {'merged': 0})\nendif```\nとかやっています","ts":"1622265346.392600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01ATUT6PL3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aD2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"475da58e-3242-42ed-80da-932eeb782c39","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"ありがとうございます！　repo をローカルパスに変更したあとは  `:call dein#update()` であってますかね？","ts":"1622265329.392200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RYU9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"50fc8226-42d6-407f-a53f-d8350d6576d7","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ファイルシステムのパス指定したら読んでくれますね","ts":"1622265313.391700","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1622265317.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6MVa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"16d17a3f-524b-44d0-878b-2dc6273d61ca","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"プラグイン開発でめちゃくちゃ助かるんですよね、ローカル読み込み","ts":"1622265272.391100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ","U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"de